  unitName: Noah
  unitId: 20494
  unitNumber: 778
  description: A mock Unit modeled after Noah, a Summoner of the Regular Army. Before,
    Noah was the commanding officer of the Demon Slayers, and everyone had very high
    expectations of him and his future. However, after failing a certain demon subjugating
    mission, he left the division responsible for it, and returned to the Regular
    Army as a mere Summoner. Afterwards, Noah came to dislike making friends and
    became completely independent of others, forging his skills alone as best as
    he possibly could.
  summonDesc: You wanna use me?<br>Don't make me laugh.<br>You think you're stronger
    than me?
  fusionDesc: I don't believe in handouts of power.<br>To become stronger<br>all
    I need is my own will.
